  "readme_html": "\n        \n          <p><img src=\"/assets/library/deepseek-v3/069ccc94-63b0-41e6-b2b3-e8e56068ab1a\" width=\"320\"/></p>\n\n<p><strong>DeepSeek-V4-Pro</strong> is the flagship model in the DeepSeek-V4 series — a Mixture-of-Experts model with 1.6T total parameters and 49B activated, built for frontier-level reasoning across a 1M-token context window.</p>\n\n<p>3 Thinking modes:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>No thinking: used for fast, intuitive answers</li>\n<li>Thinking: used for careful logical analysis</li>\n<li>Max thinking: maximum reasoning effort on the hardest problems</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Reference</h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash/blob/main/DeepSeek_V4.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">DeepSeek-V4 technical report</a></p>\n\n        \n      "
